+[[content.javascript.log_message.excludes]]
+=== content.javascript.log_message.excludes
+JavaScript messages to exclude from the qutebrowser UI.
+When a JavaScript message comes from a source matching a glob pattern in the key, and its text matches one of the glob patterns in the value, it is not shown in the UI, even if its level is enabled by `content.javascript.log_message.levels`.
+The patterns match the message text without its source or line number. Excluded messages are still handled by `content.javascript.log`.
